      "writtenOn": "2017-06-19T01:31:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see this lambda repeated again and again. Maybe there is something you could try to automate this step a bit more:\n\nOn the CbResults class, add an instance method:\n\npublic CallbackType callback() {\n  return (boolean success, String errMsg) -\u003e {\n    this.success \u003d success;\n    this.errMsg \u003d errMsg;\n  };\n}\n\nThen you can do mOffloadControl.setLocalPrefixes(localPrefixes, results.callback());\n\n\n\n\nIt might even be possible to define the function\n\npublic CallbackType setResults(boolean success, String errMsg) {\n  this.success \u003d success;\n  this.errMsg \u003d errMsg;\n}\n\nand do mOffloadControl.setLocalPrefixes(localPrefixes, results.setResults); with automatic eta-expansion (methods become objects).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 117,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 120,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "5da6d2eb7f671dfcebbbe5b0f053372ac50fb87a",
